@{
    ViewData["Title"] = "The System";
}

<div class="os-page-header">
    <div class="os-section-eyebrow">02 &mdash; The system</div>
    <h1 class="font-serif">Set It Once.<br>It Holds the House All Night.</h1>
    <p class="os-page-subhead">Intelligent oxygen management, designed to work automatically.</p>
</div>

<section class="sys-intro">
    <p>The Oxygen Solutions system is designed to continuously monitor oxygen concentration throughout the home and automatically adjust operation based on real-time conditions. Once the desired altitude-equivalency setting is selected, the system takes care of the rest.</p>
</section>

<section class="sys-features">

    <div class="sys-feature">
        <div class="sys-feature-marker">
            <span class="sys-feature-num font-mono">01</span>
            <div class="sys-feature-line"></div>
        </div>
        <div class="sys-feature-body">
            <h2 class="font-serif">Real-Time Monitoring, Room by Room</h2>
            <p>Integrated sensors continuously read oxygen concentration in individual rooms. This gives the system a live understanding of conditions throughout the home rather than relying on a single reading from one location.</p>
            <p>The system uses this information to determine when and where adjustments are needed.</p>
        </div>
    </div>

    <div class="sys-feature">
        <div class="sys-feature-marker">
            <span class="sys-feature-num font-mono">02</span>
            <div class="sys-feature-line"></div>
        </div>
        <div class="sys-feature-body">
            <h2 class="font-serif">Set Your Desired Level</h2>
            <p>The controller allows the desired altitude-equivalency setting to be established according to the system&rsquo;s operating parameters. Once configured, there is no need for constant manual adjustment.</p>
            <p>The system continuously monitors conditions and responds automatically.</p>
        </div>
    </div>

    <div class="sys-feature">
        <div class="sys-feature-marker">
            <span class="sys-feature-num font-mono">03</span>
            <div class="sys-feature-line"></div>
        </div>
        <div class="sys-feature-body">
            <h2 class="font-serif">Automatic Cycling</h2>
            <p>The system is designed to enrich oxygen when needed and cycle down automatically once the desired conditions are reached. This automated process helps maintain consistent operation while reducing the need for continuous user intervention.</p>
        </div>
    </div>

    <div class="sys-feature">
        <div class="sys-feature-marker">
            <span class="sys-feature-num font-mono">04</span>
            <div class="sys-feature-line"></div>
        </div>
        <div class="sys-feature-body">
            <h2 class="font-serif">Designed for Overnight Operation</h2>
            <p>Set the system before you settle in for the night, and its automated controls continue monitoring conditions throughout the home. The combination of room-level sensing, intelligent control, and automatic cycling allows the system to operate continuously while you sleep.</p>
        </div>
    </div>

</section>

<div class="sys-summary">
    <div class="sys-summary-inner">
        <div class="sys-summary-label font-mono">One System. Continuous Awareness.</div>
        <p>From live room-by-room monitoring to automatic adjustments, Oxygen Solutions brings intelligent control to the way oxygen concentration is managed throughout the home.</p>
        <p class="sys-summary-tagline font-serif">Set it once. Let the system monitor, adjust, and cycle automatically.</p>
    </div>
</div>

<section class="sys-cta">
    <div class="sys-cta-inner">
        <h2 class="font-serif">Discover How the System Works</h2>
        <p>Contact Oxygen Solutions to learn more about the technology, installation requirements, and available system configurations.</p>
        <div class="sys-cta-actions">
            <a asp-controller="Contact" asp-action="Index" class="btn-solid">Talk to our team</a>
            <a asp-controller="Contact" asp-action="FindInstaller" class="btn-outline">Find an installer</a>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>
